"355":"<span class=\"plain-gist\"><span class=\"gist-row\"><span class=\"gist-k\" data-hl-ui=\"\">1. 是什么</span>用识别矩假设把参数空间的距离，换成特征平均值空间距离的 <span class=\"katex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span> 倍。</span><span class=\"gist-row gist-origin\"><span class=\"gist-k\" data-hl-ui=\"\">2. 怎么推导来的</span><span class=\"typeset-prose\">对 <span class=\"katex\" data-prose-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9344em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9344em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"width:calc(100% - 0.1667em);margin-left:0.1667em;top:-3.6944em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg height=\"0.24em\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 1062 239\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\" data-prose-tex=\"\\theta \"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span></span> 直接使用逆 Lipschitz 可识别性假设 </span><a class=\"eq-ref\" href=\"#eq-24\">(24)</a>。<span class=\"gist-dependencies\"><span class=\"gist-dependency-label\">用到</span><a class=\"eq-ref\" href=\"#eq-24\">(24)</a></span></span><span class=\"gist-row\"><span class=\"gist-k\" data-hl-ui=\"\">3. 有什么用</span>用 (24)<span class=\"gist-dependencies\"><span class=\"gist-dependency-label\">用于／支撑公式</span><a class=\"eq-ref\" href=\"#eq-356\">(356)</a></span></span></span><!--structure--><figure class=\"eq-fig eq-structure\"><ol class=\"proof-map\"><li class=\"proof-step\">估计经验矩向量</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"proof-arrow\">›</li><li aria-current=\"step\" class=\"proof-step current\">投影并反演矩映射</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"proof-arrow\">›</li><li class=\"proof-step\">恢复原参数</li></ol><figcaption>这条公式在证明中的作用。</figcaption></figure><!--/structure--><span class=\"plain-syms\"><span class=\"plain-sub\">符号速查</span><!--study-symbols--><span class=\"sym-k\"><span class=\"typeset-prose\"><span class=\"katex\" data-prose-tex=\"\\mu\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"sym-v\">用于恢复参数的总体矩映射。</span><!--/study-symbols--><span class=\"sym-k\"><span class=\"katex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"sym-v\">指纹放大倍数</span></span><span class=\"plain-sub\">这条式子在说什么</span><span class=\"plain-more\">逆 Lipschitz 条件 (24)：参数误差 ≤ <span class=\"katex\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span> × 指纹误差。</span>",
